        "TileImage": "$($repository 799e5b66-b968-4ecf-b2f5-a99a892138fe).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings Agent,\r\rThe Milton-Fitzpatrick bank in New York has just experienced a break-in of severe proportions. The CEO of said bank is placing a contract to identify and eliminate the threats. The nature of the break-in leads our client to believe that these were insider threats.\r\rOur intel has identified the saboteurs as Ruby Red, an investigative journalist. Lewis Thomas, a prospective new-hire for an esteemed position, and Tim Weimer, the very secretary of the CEO.\r\rGood hunting, Agent.",
